# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) to develop with sync turned on. Leave it
# unset and the app stays purely local: no network calls at all.
#
# With sync on, the dev server proxies /api to the local API, so run both:
#   pnpm build && pnpm dev:api    # API + local D1 on :8788 (see .dev.vars.example)
#   pnpm dev                      # app on :5173
# The local D1 starts empty; create its tables once with:
#   pnpm exec wrangler d1 migrations apply orchard --local
VITE_SYNC=1
